    "help_rules": "The Veil Arena is a real-time duel against another player. You need at least 10 different homunculi. Wins earn Aster and Veil Echoes; losses cost Aster. Your Grade follows your Aster, just like in the Astral Arena.",
    "help_draft": "Team draft: each side picks 5 homunculi in turns (1, 2, 2, 2, 2 and 1, starting with the first player). What one side picked the other cannot pick. Then each player bans 1 of the rival's 5 and chooses the Leader among the 4 left. Every decision has a time limit: when it runs out, the automatic picks for you and the next limit is halved, down to 3 seconds.",
